  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 350°F (180°C).",
    "Cut bread into 1-inch cubes and place in a large mixing bowl.",
    "In a separate bowl, whisk together eggs, milk, brown sugar, cinnamon, and nutmeg.",
    "Pour the wet ingredients over the bread and stir until bread is evenly coated.",
    "Add melted butter, Jamaican spice blend, and mix well.",
    "Pour mixture into a 9x13 inch baking dish.",
    "Bake for 35-40 minutes or until golden brown.",
    "Let cool for 10 minutes before serving."
